    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm drone offers a realistic drone flight experience. Practice your flight skills in the training ground and enjoy various game modes. All controls can be handled with just one keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a skilled drone pilot through flight training!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical drone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard input</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Attack mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure Hunt mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivery mode</p></li></ul>",
